1
00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:10,800
Shield of honor

2
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:13,510
forged in passion.

3
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:23,160
Ming.

4
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:24,510
Dad.

5
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:27,800
Why did you leave
the door open while sleeping?

6
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:31,670
I forgot to close it.

7
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:34,000
You scared me to death.

8
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:36,790
Dad, I'm a little hungry.

9
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:39,750
Mom left some food for us.

10
00:00:40,390 --> 00:00:42,520
I want to eat with you, Dad.

11
00:00:42,710 --> 00:00:43,790
What a good boy, Ming.

12
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:46,880
Alright, I'll go close the door.

13
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Wait for me here.

14
00:01:18,940 --> 00:01:22,940
=Medical Examiner Dr. Qin: Bones of the Past=
=Episode 11=

15
00:01:35,230 --> 00:01:36,680
Severe defense wounds on both hands.

16
00:01:36,950 --> 00:01:39,230
Over ten pass-through injuries
on both upper arms.

17
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:40,100
When it happened,

18
00:01:40,100 --> 00:01:41,810
Li Tingxiang must have been
the one who opened the door.

19
00:01:42,840 --> 00:01:43,840
Hello, you are...

20
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:46,710
Four wound sites on the chest,

21
00:01:46,710 --> 00:01:48,350
three of which are stab wounds.

22
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:51,870
Two stab wounds hit the ribs,

23
00:01:51,870 --> 00:01:52,790
reaching the subcutaneous tissue.

24
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:54,540
Another went through
the intercostal space

25
00:01:54,540 --> 00:01:55,590
and stabbed into the thoracic cavity.

26
00:01:55,590 --> 00:01:57,430
There's patterned contusion
around the wound margin.

27
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:58,680
This wound is very deep.

28
00:01:58,680 --> 00:02:00,590
The blade must have
been thrust into the chest cavity.

29
00:02:02,510 --> 00:02:04,920
The guard at the front of the hilt
pressed against the skin,

30
00:02:04,950 --> 00:02:06,560
forming this ring-shaped contusion.

31
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:08,190
That was a brutal attack.

32
00:02:08,190 --> 00:02:09,000
The victim is passing us

33
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:10,280
a message about the murder weapon.

34
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:12,090
We'll measure the wound track shortly,

35
00:02:12,090 --> 00:02:13,910
which will help reconstruct
the approximate length of the dagger.

36
00:02:13,910 --> 00:02:15,120
If we can confirm it's a stab wound

37
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:16,190
rather than a stab-cut wound,

38
00:02:16,520 --> 00:02:19,030
we can determine
the general shape of the dagger.

39
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:22,470
A stab is a vertical motion,

40
00:02:22,750 --> 00:02:25,360
whereas a stab-cut
involves plunging in first

41
00:02:25,590 --> 00:02:27,680
and then slicing along
the edge of the blade.

42
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:29,120
That's two actions, right?

43
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,870
Exactly. A pure stab wound
has straight edges

44
00:02:30,870 --> 00:02:31,840
without any deviation.

45
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:33,520
A stab-cut wound cannot be

46
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:34,910
entirely along the same plane.

47
00:02:35,190 --> 00:02:36,560
So there will be angular turns.

48
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:38,240
Only a pure stab wound
accurately reflects

49
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:39,590
the cross-sectional shape of the dagger.

50
00:02:41,310 --> 00:02:43,430
The cuts on the clothing are
also consistent with stab wounds.

51
00:02:47,360 --> 00:02:49,590
There's another stab wound on the back.

52
00:02:49,910 --> 00:02:50,860
This wound should be much shorter

53
00:02:50,860 --> 00:02:52,620
than the ones on the front of the chest.

54
00:03:00,870 --> 00:03:01,800
The probe indicates

55
00:03:02,190 --> 00:03:03,430
that the wound
penetrated the chest cavity

56
00:03:04,030 --> 00:03:04,960
and goes quite deep.

57
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:06,430
Stay safe.

58
00:03:06,430 --> 00:03:07,120
Let's move out!

59
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:07,750
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

60
00:03:12,870 --> 00:03:13,680
Chief.

61
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:14,590
Captain Qin.

62
00:03:14,870 --> 00:03:16,680
Something happened at
Daxin Paper Mill on Jiefang Road.

63
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:18,590
A man named Zhang Daxin
is holding another man,

64
00:03:18,590 --> 00:03:19,840
Huo Jianjun, at knifepoint.

65
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:20,750
Dispatch says

66
00:03:20,750 --> 00:03:22,240
Zhang Daxin has lost
control of his emotions.

67
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:23,400
They need backup at the scene.

68
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:25,080
Daxin Paper Mill is in our jurisdiction.

69
00:03:25,080 --> 00:03:26,360
I've already dispatched a team.

70
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:28,030
Huo Jianjun is in the suspect's hands.

71
00:03:28,150 --> 00:03:28,960
Status unknown.

72
00:03:29,150 --> 00:03:30,030
Huo Jianjun?

73
00:03:30,630 --> 00:03:31,960
What's his connection to Huo Qicheng?

74
00:03:32,030 --> 00:03:33,400
He's Huo Qicheng's younger brother.

75
00:03:33,630 --> 00:03:35,120
He usually helps
Huo Qicheng with investments

76
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:36,280
and recruiting investors.

77
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,000
Li.

78
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,280
Zhang Daxin's wife, Wang Lanhua,

79
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:41,310
is also a victim of the Urban
Construction fundraising scheme.

80
00:03:41,310 --> 00:03:42,870
We need the special task force
and economic crime unit

81
00:03:42,870 --> 00:03:43,870
to work on this together.

82
00:03:43,910 --> 00:03:44,960
Not a single suspect

83
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:45,960
can be allowed to escape.

84
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:46,680
Yes, sir.

85
00:03:46,840 --> 00:03:47,680
Li, let's go.

86
00:03:48,470 --> 00:03:49,280
Qin,

87
00:03:50,630 --> 00:03:51,910
you must bring Zhang Daxin back alive.

88
00:03:51,910 --> 00:03:53,590
He's crucial to
investigating the raised funds.

89
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,030
Don't worry.

90
00:03:55,770 --> 00:03:57,230
(Longfan City PSB Pretrial Section)
Ensure the safety of the hostage.

91
00:03:57,230 --> 00:03:57,900
(Longfan City)
You must bring Zhang Daxin back.

92
00:03:57,900 --> 00:03:58,870
( PSB Criminal Investigation Detachment)
You must bring Zhang Daxin back.

93
00:03:58,870 --> 00:03:59,590
Understood.

94
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:03,120
How could there be
two different wound tracks?

95
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:05,750
The lungs, pericardium,

96
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:07,960
heart, and aorta all have lacerations.

97
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:10,240
That chest stab

98
00:04:10,470 --> 00:04:12,870
entered the thoracic cavity through
the 7th and 8th intercostal spaces

99
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:14,120
along the anterior axillary line,

100
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:15,710
punctured the left lung,

101
00:04:15,710 --> 00:04:17,070
pierced the pericardium,

102
00:04:17,070 --> 00:04:18,480
and left a wound roughly 2 mm long

103
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:20,120
on the left ventricle.

104
00:04:20,630 --> 00:04:22,920
The length of the wound track is 16 cm.

105
00:04:23,310 --> 00:04:25,560
The killer's weapon is about 16 cm long,

106
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:26,830
and the widest part of the blade

107
00:04:27,190 --> 00:04:28,310
is roughly 7 cm.

108
00:04:30,750 --> 00:04:33,830
This dagger isn't long,
but it's very wide.

109
00:04:34,750 --> 00:04:38,190
It should be the short
and thick type of dagger.

110
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:40,800
But the wound on the victim's back

111
00:04:40,940 --> 00:04:43,240
entered the chest cavity
between the ribs,

112
00:04:43,240 --> 00:04:44,240
just inside the right shoulder blade,

113
00:04:44,510 --> 00:04:46,680
pierced the right lung and mediastinum,

114
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:47,830
and caused a roughly 5-mm rupture

115
00:04:47,830 --> 00:04:49,680
at the root of the aorta.

116
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,680
If that's the case,

117
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:52,560
the length of this murder weapon

118
00:04:52,630 --> 00:04:54,360
must be at least 16 cm.

119
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:56,750
Yet the length
of the wound on the victim's back

120
00:04:56,750 --> 00:04:58,000
is only 3 cm.

121
00:05:00,310 --> 00:05:02,270
These are two different daggers.

122
00:05:04,270 --> 00:05:07,600
So, which weapon caused his death?

123
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:10,070
Both of these injuries could
have caused the victim's death.

124
00:05:10,750 --> 00:05:11,750
The stab to the chest...

125
00:05:11,830 --> 00:05:14,240
A rupture of the cardiac apex would
surely lead to pericardial tamponade

126
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:15,630
or death from excessive blood loss.

127
00:05:15,630 --> 00:05:17,000
The stab in the back ruptured the aorta,

128
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,390
which would also lead
to excessive blood loss.

129
00:05:18,390 --> 00:05:19,720
So, are you saying

130
00:05:19,870 --> 00:05:22,120
that these two knives can be
considered joint causes of death?

131
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:24,870
One stab was already fatal.

132
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:27,390
Why add another stab?

133
00:05:27,390 --> 00:05:30,120
And with two different weapons, no less.

134
00:05:37,950 --> 00:05:38,750
Get up.

135
00:05:39,310 --> 00:05:40,120
Get up.

136
00:05:40,310 --> 00:05:41,120
Get up!

137
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:42,390
It hurts...

138
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:45,560
Zhang Daxin... Xin,

139
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:47,000
I'll give you whatever you want.

140
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:48,040
Please

141
00:05:48,390 --> 00:05:49,120
let me go.

142
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:49,830
Shut up.

143
00:05:51,390 --> 00:05:52,680
Stand back!

144
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:54,000
Or I'll chop him.

145
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,040
Zhang Daxin,

146
00:05:58,160 --> 00:06:00,920
I'm Qin Tian, Captain of the Municipal
Criminal Investigation Bureau.

147
00:06:01,390 --> 00:06:02,830
Whatever it is, talk to me.

148
00:06:02,830 --> 00:06:04,390
Huo Jianjun cheated me out of my money.

149
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:06,310
I must get my money back!

150
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:10,160
Huo Jianjun is being held
hostage behind the counter

151
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:11,530
with a knife to his neck.

152
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,160
Prepare to breach the door in a moment.

153
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:14,510
Zhang Daxin's son, Zhang Xiaoshan,

154
00:06:14,510 --> 00:06:15,720
is crying out for his dad.

155
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:17,310
Right now?

156
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:19,720
He says he can stop
his dad from making a mistake.

157
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:21,000
We're holding him back outside,

158
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:21,920
but he insists on rushing in.

159
00:06:21,950 --> 00:06:23,000
Send someone to bring him over.

160
00:06:23,070 --> 00:06:24,120
Keep the child safe.

161
00:06:25,390 --> 00:06:26,190
Zhang Daxin,

162
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:29,190
calm down. No need to be so nervous.

163
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,270
Put the knife down first.

164
00:06:30,270 --> 00:06:31,680
We're here to resolve the issue.

165
00:06:34,750 --> 00:06:36,870
Back off! I see a gun!

166
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:39,270
Put the gun down.

167
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:40,920
Put it down.

168
00:06:42,160 --> 00:06:43,800
You're not here to help me.

169
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:45,560
You're here to help him.

170
00:06:49,070 --> 00:06:50,390
The law is fair.

171
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:51,480
If you break the law,

172
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:53,120
we have to arrest you.

173
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:54,310
If you've been wronged,

174
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:56,630
we will seek justice for you.

175
00:06:56,630 --> 00:06:58,720
I am the victim.

176
00:06:59,270 --> 00:07:01,000
Why are you helping him?

177
00:07:01,460 --> 00:07:03,220
(Longfan Urban Construction Group
Fundraising Contract)

178
00:07:08,060 --> 00:07:12,060
(Party B: Wang Lanhua)

179
00:07:13,310 --> 00:07:14,120
Lanhua,

180
00:07:15,270 --> 00:07:16,190
what are you doing?

181
00:07:16,510 --> 00:07:17,390
Come down now.

182
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:18,680
I can't.

183
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:21,560
The house is gone.

184
00:07:22,190 --> 00:07:23,390
The money is gone.

185
00:07:24,270 --> 00:07:26,390
Everything is gone.

186
00:07:26,390 --> 00:07:27,510
You still have Xiaoshan.

187
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:29,000
You still have me.

188
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:31,190
Don't come over.

189
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:35,750
I'll go to Huo Qicheng about the money.

190
00:07:35,750 --> 00:07:37,560
I'll get our money back.

191
00:07:38,360 --> 00:07:42,360
It's not coming back.

192
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,310
Breach the door. Hurry!

193
00:08:29,270 --> 00:08:31,070
Ding Hua's condition

194
00:08:31,070 --> 00:08:32,840
is the same as Li Tingxiang's.

195
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:35,360
Both have two stabs to
the chest and one to the back,

196
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:37,150
and both were inflicted
by two different weapons.

197
00:08:37,150 --> 00:08:38,390
But I remember

198
00:08:38,390 --> 00:08:40,120
when Li Yan reported the case, he said

199
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:42,600
only one person broke into their home.

200
00:08:42,630 --> 00:08:44,480
How could one person have two weapons?

201
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:45,630
Generally speaking,

202
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:47,670
it's unlikely for one
person to dual-wield.

203
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:50,240
As for how many assailants
were actually at the scene,

204
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:52,750
we'll have to wait for Lin Tao's
crime scene investigation results.

205
00:08:52,910 --> 00:08:53,910
My dad used to say

206
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:55,390
solving a case

207
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:57,670
is like solving
a complex geometry problem.

208
00:08:57,750 --> 00:08:59,390
Many seemingly unrelated clues,

209
00:08:59,630 --> 00:09:00,910
once connected,

210
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:02,870
can reveal the hidden logic behind them.

211
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,550
Often, the more complex
a crime scene is,

212
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:06,320
the simpler the truth hidden behind it.

213
00:09:07,270 --> 00:09:08,630
And the simpler the truth,

214
00:09:08,630 --> 00:09:09,870
the more direct the motive.

215
00:09:10,960 --> 00:09:13,320
It's usually extreme love

216
00:09:14,030 --> 00:09:15,240
or extreme hatred.

217
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:18,480
Both victims died from
these two types of weapons.

218
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:20,080
Two types of weapons?

219
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:20,750
Yes.

220
00:09:20,910 --> 00:09:23,320
Not only is there
a heavy overlap in the weapons used,

221
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:25,150
but the extra tool marks

222
00:09:25,150 --> 00:09:26,320
are also all on their backs.

223
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:28,000
Both victims were lying face down,

224
00:09:28,030 --> 00:09:31,440
so they were likely
stabbed from the front first,

225
00:09:31,670 --> 00:09:32,960
and then stabbed again from behind.

226
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:34,240
You mean

227
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:36,360
the killer first used
a large dagger to kill them,

228
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:38,080
and after the two
lost their ability to resist,

229
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:39,720
used a small dagger
to stab them again from behind?

230
00:09:40,550 --> 00:09:41,670
Dual-wielding?

231
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:43,670
Dual-wielding was
our initial thought too.

232
00:09:44,150 --> 00:09:46,000
Cases where a killer carries two weapons

233
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:46,870
are rare,

234
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:48,120
but not unheard of.

235
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:50,030
How's the forensic
examination of the scene?

236
00:09:50,030 --> 00:09:52,960
Can it determine
if there was one killer or two?

237
00:09:52,980 --> 00:09:54,910
A total of four sets

238
00:09:54,910 --> 00:09:56,320
of relatively intact bloody
footprints were collected.

239
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:58,120
We're still waiting
for the analysis results.

240
00:09:59,550 --> 00:10:00,360
Chief,

241
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:03,600
should we confirm with Li Yan once more?

242
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:05,630
Is it possible that when he reported it,

243
00:10:05,630 --> 00:10:06,790
he was in such a panic

244
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:08,670
that he mistook two people for one?

245
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:21,790
Officer,

246
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:25,390
how are my parents?

247
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:36,870
They

248
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:40,870
didn't make it.

249
00:10:51,630 --> 00:10:52,440
I see.

250
00:10:58,720 --> 00:11:00,000
You don't have to hold it in.

251
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:01,870
It's okay to cry.

252
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:05,150
Officer,

253
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:11,360
are you here to ask me
about what happened back then?

254
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:13,440
Please ask me.

255
00:11:14,270 --> 00:11:15,910
I want to catch
the killer as soon as possible.

256
00:11:34,660 --> 00:11:36,340
(Reception Room)

257
00:11:39,870 --> 00:11:40,670
Qin.

258
00:11:41,670 --> 00:11:42,480
How did it go?

259
00:11:42,870 --> 00:11:43,670
I asked him.

260
00:11:43,790 --> 00:11:45,720
At the time,
someone knocked on the door,

261
00:11:45,720 --> 00:11:46,870
and Li Tingxiang went to open it.

262
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:48,320
Ding Hua was cooking in the kitchen,

263
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:49,720
and Li Yan was staying in his room.

264
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:51,840
Ding Hua and Li Yan
heard Li Tingxiang's screams,

265
00:11:51,840 --> 00:11:52,510
and after going out,

266
00:11:52,510 --> 00:11:54,120
found that Li Tingxiang
had already been stabbed.

267
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:56,750
Ding Hua quickly
pushed Li Yan into the study,

268
00:11:56,750 --> 00:11:58,360
telling him to lock the door.

269
00:11:58,630 --> 00:11:59,720
Li Yan was terrified.

270
00:12:00,030 --> 00:12:02,200
He heard noises outside
multiple times and wanted to go out,

271
00:12:02,270 --> 00:12:03,960
but Li Tingxiang
and Ding Hua stopped him.

272
00:12:04,910 --> 00:12:06,150
How many killers did he see?

273
00:12:06,390 --> 00:12:07,200
One.

274
00:12:10,550 --> 00:12:11,960
Here are the results
of the footprint comparison.

275
00:12:12,670 --> 00:12:14,480
I need to examine
Li Tingxiang's body again.

276
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:15,550
There are new doubts?

277
00:12:46,220 --> 00:12:47,980
(Forensic Autopsy Examination Record)

278
00:12:56,100 --> 00:13:00,180
(Captain Qin Tian died heroically on Oct 16
while pursuing suspect Zhang Daxin)

279
00:13:03,780 --> 00:13:05,020
(Died heroically)

280
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:32,150
Dad.

281
00:13:32,150 --> 00:13:33,080
Can you hear me, Dad?

282
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:34,120
Please respond if you hear me, Dad.

283
00:13:34,390 --> 00:13:35,670
Dad, listen to me.

284
00:13:35,670 --> 00:13:36,630
Zhang Daxin has a gun.

285
00:13:36,720 --> 00:13:38,000
Zhang Daxin has a gun.
Did you hear that?

286
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:38,960
Did you hear me?

287
00:13:42,240 --> 00:13:43,030
Zhang Daxin.

288
00:13:44,790 --> 00:13:45,670
Zhang Daxin.

289
00:13:57,960 --> 00:13:59,480
Do you really think you can get away?

290
00:13:59,790 --> 00:14:02,150
Before you cause
any serious consequences,

291
00:14:02,150 --> 00:14:03,000
drop the knife.

292
00:14:03,200 --> 00:14:04,360
We can still talk this over.

293
00:14:04,550 --> 00:14:05,960
If you harm the hostage,

294
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:07,870
there'll be no turning back.

295
00:14:11,080 --> 00:14:12,270
Put down your gun first.

296
00:14:16,790 --> 00:14:18,630
Xin...

297
00:14:22,440 --> 00:14:23,720
Dad,

298
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:24,630
I'm begging you.

299
00:14:25,360 --> 00:14:27,080
I really can't lose you again.

300
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:28,390
Please.

301
00:14:29,080 --> 00:14:29,870
Dad!

302
00:14:30,670 --> 00:14:31,480
Speak up.

303
00:14:32,150 --> 00:14:32,960
What are your terms?

304
00:14:32,960 --> 00:14:34,360
Huo Jianjun scammed me out of my money

305
00:14:34,750 --> 00:14:36,120
and drove my wife to her death.

306
00:14:36,120 --> 00:14:37,790
My condition is a life for a life.

307
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:39,670
Regarding the Urban Construction
Group Fundraising Case,

308
00:14:40,480 --> 00:14:42,320
you are not the only victim.

309
00:14:42,720 --> 00:14:44,150
The police have already
stepped in to investigate,

310
00:14:44,150 --> 00:14:46,630
and we will recover
the raised funds as soon as possible

311
00:14:47,240 --> 00:14:49,000
to distribute back to all the victims.

312
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:50,630
Please trust the ability of the police.

313
00:14:53,790 --> 00:14:54,750
Recovering the stolen money?

314
00:14:55,720 --> 00:14:56,870
What high-sounding nonsense!

315
00:14:57,270 --> 00:14:58,670
Where were you all earlier?

316
00:14:59,750 --> 00:15:00,600
Answer me.

317
00:15:01,750 --> 00:15:03,000
Please answer me.

318
00:15:11,840 --> 00:15:13,720
I don't give a darn about
recovering the money anymore.

319
00:15:14,080 --> 00:15:15,270
I just want him dead!

320
00:15:16,550 --> 00:15:17,870
Don't think I won't do it.

321
00:15:18,120 --> 00:15:19,440
I've got nothing left.

322
00:15:19,440 --> 00:15:21,000
My wife is dead.

323
00:15:21,390 --> 00:15:22,200
She's dead.

324
00:15:23,270 --> 00:15:24,360
What about your son then?

325
00:15:24,870 --> 00:15:25,960
Who's going to look after your son?

326
00:15:26,670 --> 00:15:28,270
He's already on his way here.

327
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:29,510
Son?

328
00:15:33,550 --> 00:15:35,510
Why did you bring my son here?

329
00:15:35,840 --> 00:15:37,910
You're not here to help me at all.

330
00:15:38,840 --> 00:15:39,670
Zhang Daxin!

331
00:15:51,220 --> 00:15:53,380
(Winter, 2000)

332
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:57,320
How did this happen?

333
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:02,270
What triggered this?

334
00:16:04,440 --> 00:16:05,440
How could this happen?

335
00:16:22,630 --> 00:16:23,270
Dad.

336
00:16:52,740 --> 00:16:54,700
(A major home-invasion robbery
and murder occurred in the city)

337
00:16:54,700 --> 00:16:56,520
(A mother and son lost their lives.
The killer fled the scene)

338
00:16:58,280 --> 00:16:59,900
(Lin Luoxia returned home from work
and found the front door pried open)

339
00:16:59,900 --> 00:17:01,140
(The two were lying in
the living room and entryway)

340
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:03,080
What happened?

341
00:17:03,120 --> 00:17:04,110
What really happened?

342
00:17:04,110 --> 00:17:06,000
Why can't I remember anything?

343
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:15,480
Ming.

344
00:17:17,510 --> 00:17:18,310
Ming!

345
00:17:19,590 --> 00:17:20,640
Dad,

346
00:17:20,640 --> 00:17:22,000
do you copy?

347
00:17:22,030 --> 00:17:23,400
Do you copy?

348
00:17:27,070 --> 00:17:28,550
Dad.

349
00:17:35,310 --> 00:17:36,350
Dad,

350
00:17:36,350 --> 00:17:37,590
do you copy?

351
00:17:37,590 --> 00:17:39,000
Do you copy?

352
00:17:40,030 --> 00:17:41,640
Why aren't you answering?

353
00:17:42,920 --> 00:17:43,790
Never mind.

354
00:17:51,110 --> 00:17:52,070
Dad,

355
00:17:52,070 --> 00:17:53,200
do you copy?

356
00:17:53,200 --> 00:17:54,550
Do you copy?

357
00:18:07,350 --> 00:18:08,310
Dad.

358
00:18:09,070 --> 00:18:10,030
Dad...

359
00:18:13,970 --> 00:18:18,490
♪The old walkie-talkie I treasure♪

360
00:18:21,560 --> 00:18:26,340
♪The birthday surprise
you gave me that year♪

361
00:18:29,050 --> 00:18:34,430
♪Its buttons worn
and weathered with time♪

362
00:18:34,960 --> 00:18:40,290
♪Still echoing your words,
"Be brave and keep moving on"♪

363
00:18:42,320 --> 00:18:50,280
♪The old train rolled over
our reluctance to part♪

364
00:18:50,910 --> 00:18:55,960
♪You waved goodbye
and faded into the night♪

365
00:18:58,000 --> 00:19:06,310
♪I used to think
we'd always have more time♪

366
00:19:06,310 --> 00:19:12,160
♪But that goodbye became the last♪

367
00:19:13,620 --> 00:19:21,740
♪I carry the warmth you left behind♪

368
00:19:22,430 --> 00:19:27,470
♪Making my way
through every door in life♪

369
00:19:29,250 --> 00:19:37,290
♪Whenever a train
whistle sounds at night♪

370
00:19:37,570 --> 00:19:44,840
♪I suddenly long to call out to you♪

371
00:19:45,040 --> 00:19:49,450
♪Can you hear me?♪

372
00:19:49,460 --> 00:19:53,250
♪Can you hear me?♪

373
00:19:53,250 --> 00:20:00,710
♪Let the old receiver
carry the words I never said♪

374
00:20:00,710 --> 00:20:08,450
♪I've taken on
both your duty and your love♪

375
00:20:08,780 --> 00:20:14,390
♪This train has no return, and when I
look back, you're no longer waiting♪

376
00:20:16,270 --> 00:20:19,870
♪After all these years♪

377
00:20:22,380 --> 00:20:29,860
♪How I wish I could
talk to you just one more time♪

378
00:20:30,760 --> 00:20:32,060
♪And tell you♪

379
00:20:33,280 --> 00:20:36,550
♪I haven't let you down♪
